[{"answer":"Good afternoon, Dreamtime Travel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/1.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm interested in the holidays you offer along the coast near here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. We operate several tours up the coast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Where in particular did you want to go?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I like the sound of the holiday that mentioned whales.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Was it 'Whale Watching\"?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's our Whale Watch Experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It's very popular","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's based in a lovely little town with nice beaches.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right, and how long does it last?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/12.mp3"},{"answer":"It's two days","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/13.mp3"},{"answer":"that includes four hours' travel time each way from here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/14-2023-09-20-15-19-20.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, I don't want to be away any longer than that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/15.mp3"},{"answer":"So is that by coach?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually it's by minibus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/17.mp3"},{"answer":"We like to keep those tours small and personal so we don't take a whole coachload of people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/18.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, we only take up to fifteen people on this tour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/19.mp3"},{"answer":"although we do run it with just twelve or thirteen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/21.mp3"},{"answer":"So do you run these tours often?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it depends on the time of year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course in peak times like the summer holidays, we do them every weekend,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/24.mp3"},{"answer":"but at the moment, it's usually once a month at most.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And when is the next one going?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm, let me see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, there's one in three weeks' time which is April the 18th,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and then we don't have another one until June the 2nd.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And is April a good time to go?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Pretty good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Though the really good time is later in the year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I have to say though that the whale sighting is only one of the many things offered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The hotel itself where you stay has great facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/36.mp3"},{"answer":"It's called The Pallisades.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/37.mp3"},{"answer":"The Paris what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/38.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's actually The Pallisades,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/39.mp3"},{"answer":"PALLISADES.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/40.mp3"},{"answer":"It's right on the main beach there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/42.mp3"},{"answer":"All of the rooms have nice views and the food is really good there too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/44.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about the other things?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/45.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, that are included in the price.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, there are lots of things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/47.mp3"},{"answer":"If you don't want to do the whale watch cruise,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/48.mp3"},{"answer":"your guide will take anyone who is interested either on a bushwalk through the national park near the hotel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and there's no extra charge for that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/50.mp3"},{"answer":"or on a fishing trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/51.mp3"},{"answer":"That's an extra $12 I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's also a reptile park in town -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/53.mp3"},{"answer":"that costs more or less the same.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/54.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I think I'd prefer whales to snakes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And if you just want to relax, you are free to sit by the hotel pool or go down the beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and they also have tennis courts at the hotel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but you have to pay for those by the hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/59.mp3"},{"answer":"But there are table tennis tables downstairs","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're part of the accommodation package.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Just speak to your guide.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/63.mp3"},{"answer":"So how much is the basic tour price?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/64.mp3"},{"answer":"At this time of year, it's usually around $300 but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/65.mp3"},{"answer":"let me check.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's actually $280.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/67.mp3"},{"answer":"And the next tour, are there any places on that one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/68.mp3"},{"answer":"How many people is it for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/69.mp3"},{"answer":"There are two of us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that should be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I just mention that we require all bookings to be made at least 14 days before you travel","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/72.mp3"},{"answer":"to avoid cancellations of tours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/73.mp3"},{"answer":"And if you cancel within seven days of departure,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/74.mp3"},{"answer":"you will have to pay 50% of your total booking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/76.mp3"},{"answer":"And you also need to pay a 20% deposit at the time of booking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I pay that by credit card?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you can.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/79.mp3"},{"answer":"All right, what I'll do is I'll talk to my partner and get back to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/81.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I'll make a provisional booking, shall I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Two for the Whale Watch Experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me issue you with a customer reference number for when you call back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have a pen?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/86.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, it's 39745T.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/87.mp3"},{"answer":"That's T for tango.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/88.mp3"},{"answer":"When you call back, ask to speak to the Tour Manager, that's me, Tracy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, I will.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-1-2023-08-04-13-16-24/90.mp3"}]
